---
config:
  theme: default
description: >-
  every colour form a style value takes: `#rgba`, `#rrggbbaa`, rgb(), rgba(), hsl(), hsla() and
  currentColor; the `#12` line is dropped with C4_COLOR_INVALID and the rest is drawn
---
c4-beta container
container a "Alpha short" :::short
container b "Alpha long" :::long
container c "RGB" :::rgb
container d "HSL" :::hsl
container e "Unreadable" :::bad
a --> b : "Calls" :::tinted
c --> d : "Calls" :::text
style short fill:#cf0a, stroke:#a00
style long fill:#ff000080, stroke:#7f1d1dcc
style rgb fill:rgb(185,28,28), stroke:rgba(127, 29, 29, 0.8)
style hsl fill:hsl(210 80% 85%), stroke:hsla(210, 80%, 30%, 0.9)
style bad fill:#12
style tinted stroke:rgb(37 99 235 / 60%)
style text color:currentColor
